{"abstract":[{"text":"Some components can be used for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"layouts","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Colored-Surface","text":"Colored Surface","type":"heading"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_BlueCoat"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"BlueCoat"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Colored backgrounds use surface colors to maximize the contrast with content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The colors of several MISO components (for instance ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOButton","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLink","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":") are automatically adjusted if they are placed on ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOColoredSurface","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do so, some tokens associated with these specific colors can be customized and are identified with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Mono","type":"text"}]},{"text":" suffix (for instance ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"colorBgDefaultEnabledMono"}]},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"BlueCoatThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider","type":"text"}]},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"anchor":"How-it-works","text":"How it works","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"According to the color, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" component adds in SwiftUI environment two flags:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"misoUseMonochrome"},{"type":"text","text":": to inform a component that needs to use mono version of tokens"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"misoOnColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":": to inform a component it is placed on colored surface even if the mono is off"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":4,"anchor":"How-to-use","text":"How to use","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ The folowing view has a colored background \"onStatusPositiveEmphasized\" with","    \/\/ - a text with the color adapted according to the adjusted colorScheme      ","    \/\/ - a button that uses the mono version of tokens","","    \/\/ As view","    MISOColoredSurface(color: theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized) {","        VStack {","            Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","            .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","            MISOButton(text: \"Button\") {}","        }","    }","","    \/\/ As view modifier","","    VStack {","        Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","        .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","        MISOButton(text: \"Button\") {}","    }","    .coloredSurface(theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized)"]},{"level":4,"anchor":"Debuging-contrast-ratios","text":"Debuging contrast ratios","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is for example the case for France with the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", also named “RGAA”.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However it is highly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for texts and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Some components like ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOButton","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLink","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" can be used on ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOColoredSurface","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ; thus in that case we can know the surface color for a given component on it, and compute the contrast ratio, and in the end display or not warnings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To do that, some steps must be followed in your component implementation:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rise the flag to allow debugging (e.g. i #DEBUG mode)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get the environment variable defined by the colored surface containing the applied color"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In the component implementation, add a line of code comparing the color to test and that surface","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then keep an eye on your logs ; warnings will be added there if WCAG 2.1 3:1, 4.5:1 or 7:1 ratios are not reached, depending to the methods you call"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Rise the flag","#if DEBUG","MISOWCAG21Ratios.misoDebugWCAG21Colors = true","#endif","","\/\/ Supposing we are in your component View \/ ViewModifer struct","","\/\/ Get the applied surface color","@Environment(\\.misoSurfaceColor) var surfaceColor","","\/\/ In the function defining the color to apply, add the line below","\/\/ where colorTokenToApply is the color to apply from a theme:","","\/\/ Non-textual components, in AA","MISOWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .nonTextual)","","\/\/ Textual components and AAA to check","MISOWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .AAA)"]},{"anchor":"Divider","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Divider"},{"level":4,"anchor":"How-it-works","text":"How it works","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A divider is used to separate content elements in a view. Two kinds of divider are proposed:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOHorizontalDivider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": to separate elements stacked vertically (e.g. in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VStack"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOVerticalDivider"},{"type":"text","text":": to separate elements stacked horizontally (e.g. in `HStack)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A divider can be colored using color enumerated in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISODividerColor"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Horizontal","level":5,"anchor":"Horizontal"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_BlueCoat","type":"image"}]}],"title":"BlueCoat"}]},{"level":5,"anchor":"Vertical","text":"Vertical","type":"heading"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_BlueCoat","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"BlueCoat"}]},{"level":4,"anchor":"How-to-use","text":"How to use","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Add a vertical divider between items","HStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    MISOVerticalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}","","\/\/ Add an horizontal divider between items","VStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    MISOHorizontalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/layouts"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Layouts","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Layouts","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"card"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"sections":[],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","title":"Components","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":" extensions and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}]},"component_horizontalDivider_BlueCoat":{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_BlueCoat","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with BlueCoat theme","type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/MISOComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_BlueCoat.png"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOVerticalDivider":{"title":"MISOVerticalDivider","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOVerticalDivider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Divider is a UI element that allows to structure the content by visually separating the content zones."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Divider improves readability and content organization without introducing a stronger visual hierarchy like a heading or a container would."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A vertical Divider is used to separate content laid out side by side ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HStack"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The divider can be colored using dedicated "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISODividerColor","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" colors."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The thickness (width) is fixed by dedicated token from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOVerticalDivider","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoverticaldivider","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOVerticalDivider","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOHorizontalDivider":{"title":"MISOHorizontalDivider","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Divider is a UI element that allows to structure the content by visually separating the content zones.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Divider improves readability and content organization without introducing a stronger visual hierarchy like a heading or a container would.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A horizontal Divider is used to separate content laid out one under the other (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VStack"},{"text":").","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The divider can be colored using dedicated ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISODividerColor","type":"reference"},{"text":" colors.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The thickness (height) is fixed by dedicated token from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOHorizontalDivider","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOHorizontalDivider"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misohorizontaldivider","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOHorizontalDivider"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISODividerColor":{"title":"MISODividerColor","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"List of colors available for dividers (i.e. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOHorizontalDivider"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOVerticalDivider"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISODividerColor","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISODividerColor"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misodividercolor","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISODividerColor"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOButton":{"title":"MISOButton","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Button is a UI element that triggers an action or event, and is used to initiate tasks or confirming an action."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Button appears in different layouts, styles and states to indicate hierarchy or emphasis."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOButton","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOButton","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobutton","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOButton","kind":"identifier"}]},"component_coloredSurface_BlueCoat":{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_BlueCoat","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with BlueCoat theme","type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/MISOComponents\/component_coloredSurface_BlueCoat.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/MISOComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png"}],"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"image","alt":null},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOLink":{"title":"MISOLink","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Link is a UI element that allows to navigate from one location to another, either within the same page or across different pages in the same resource,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"or to an external resource.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Link’s primary function is navigation and it communicates its interactive nature visually and semantically.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLink","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOLink"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolink","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOLink"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOColoredSurface":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOColoredSurface","title":"MISOColoredSurface","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOColoredSurface"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misocoloredsurface","abstract":[{"text":"Used to define if a content is used on a colored surface.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOColoredSurface"}]},"https://accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr/":{"title":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité","url":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité","type":"text"}],"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/"},"component_verticalDivider_BlueCoat":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/MISOComponents\/component_verticalDivider_BlueCoat.png"}],"alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with BlueCoat theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_BlueCoat"}}}